      "end_seconds": 3.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.27,
      "end_seconds": 14.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "you're alright, take a seat what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 16.18,
      "end_seconds": 21.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.08,
      "end_seconds": 25.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.39,
      "end_seconds": 36.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "It's no real problems, mostly. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.13,
      "end_seconds": 41.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 43.3,
      "end_seconds": 59.02,
      "duration_seconds": 15.72,
      "text": "he is on atorvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol, I give it to him i mean, it's metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.6,
      "end_seconds": 67.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.11,
      "end_seconds": 71.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "It's been about a week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.09,
      "end_seconds": 76.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.51,
      "end_seconds": 80.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "pretty moderate, if I'm being honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.36,
      "end_seconds": 84.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.18,
      "end_seconds": 99.86,
      "duration_seconds": 14.68,
      "text": "A bit of back stiffness goes along with it, most of the time. Uh, and there's an occasional headache as well, ten days now. With occasional headache, mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.79,
      "end_seconds": 103.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.9,
      "end_seconds": 108.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "it, It happens a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.57,
      "end_seconds": 114.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Have you noticed chest pain, weight loss or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.71,
      "end_seconds": 118.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.95,
      "end_seconds": 123.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.53,
      "end_seconds": 127.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.15,
      "end_seconds": 133.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Alright, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.16,
      "end_seconds": 141.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "hmm, I'm allergic to erythromycin, I get bad stomach cramps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.06,
      "end_seconds": 160.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.96,
      "end_seconds": 166.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "I, I have high cholesterol. Heart failure, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.37,
      "end_seconds": 169.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.41,
      "end_seconds": 176.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "Erm, yes, I had my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.79,
      "end_seconds": 181.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.78,
      "end_seconds": 186.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.48,
      "end_seconds": 189.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.39,
      "end_seconds": 193.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.66,
      "end_seconds": 197.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.89,
      "end_seconds": 203.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.32,
      "end_seconds": 207.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.14,
      "end_seconds": 219.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.38,
      "end_seconds": 247.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.61,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 75, saturation 97 percent, BMI works out to 21.5, height 179 centimetres, temp 36.9 degrees, blood pressure 118 over 73, weight 69 kilos"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.52,
      "end_seconds": 251.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.47,
      "end_seconds": 255.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "So, that's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.04,
      "end_seconds": 261.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.39,
      "end_seconds": 276.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.66,
      "end_seconds": 279.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.07,
      "end_seconds": 298.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "your heart and lungs sound normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.77,
      "end_seconds": 304.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.76,
      "end_seconds": 347.82,
      "duration_seconds": 32.06,
      "text": "okay, so my impression is this: It points towards a healthy adult with no worrying findings i'd like to arrange a fasting sugar test for routine check keep up regular exercise and a balanced diet try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit i'll want another look in twelve months that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.27,
      "end_seconds": 352.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
